      "bbox": [
        208,
        1552,
        1658,
        1708
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The function of the staff is to draft a new charter which will\nstreamline the present city charter to provide for a more efficient and\neconomical form of government better adopted to the present day conditions\nof our city.",
